[10416]="700442F8\n1\tDefeat Warg-riders (total: 4)\tWarg-riders are located in northern Talath Anor. You should defeat Warg-riders for the safety of Crithost.\n2\tTalk to Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[10417]="70028F5A\n1\tRide horses back to Avardin (total: 3)\tHorses can be found in the fields surrounding Avardin. Levelha asked you to find and ride back several horses.\n2\tTalk to Levelha in Avardin\tLevelha is in Avardin, in the central Starkmoor. Levelha will be pleased to hear that you have brought him several horses.\n",
[10418]="7005B186\n1\tDefeat Warg-riders of Moria at Zaghúth\tWarg-riders of Moria can be found at Zaghúth. You should defeat Warg-riders of Moria at Zaghúth.\n2\tDefeat Warg-riders of Moria at Zaghúth (total: 6)\tWarg-riders of Moria can be found at Zaghúth. You should defeat Warg-riders of Moria at Zaghúth.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Warg-riders of Moria at Zaghúth.\n",
[10419]="7002F98B\n1\tFind the source of the buzzing noise\tThe source of the buzzing noise is coming from somewhere in the bog west of Harwick.\n2\tReturn to Céolstan at the Harwick Stables\tThe guard of the stables waits by Harwick's horses for you to return. You should tell the guard about the source of the buzzing.\n",
[10420]="70032942\n1\tDefeat boars on the plains near Harwick (total: 8)\tBoars can be found on the outskirts of Harwick, not far north from Feldburg. You should ride down the boars with your new war-steed.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of boars on the plains outside of Harwick.\n",
[10421]="700350C3\n1\tTalk to Húna\tHúna and the others can be found in the hidden cave in southern Balewood. You have found a smudged missive from Isengard detailing Lomor's plans before he was slain at your hand. The note spoke of trees fighting against the Orcs, so there remains a chance that allies might still be found in Balewood. You should speak to Húna and the others before seeking out the hewers.\n",
[10422]="70027E9E\n1\tGo with Guto to resolve the dispute in Trum Dreng\tGuto is at his encampment, south of the watch-tower. You should talk to Guto again when you are ready to begin your assault.\n",
[10423]="7003A4E9\n1\tFind Drytwald's ring\tThere are haystacks throughout Fenmarch. Drytwald asked you to search the hay that he delivered for his ring.\n2\tTalk to Drytwald\tDrytwald is west of the Mead Hall of Fenmarch. You were able to find Drytwald's ring near one of the haystacks and should return it to Drytwald.\n",
[10424]="7006944B\n1\tComplete Umbar Jeweller's Guild daily orders (total: 5)\tComplete requests from the Umbar Jeweller's Guild. You can acquire these quests from the Umbar Jeweller's Guild Leader in the Umbar Baharbêl craft guild hall.\n2\tCompleted\tYou completed many Umbar jeweller requests.\n",
[10425]="700006E9\n1\tReturn the Rings to Radagast the Brown\030Collect Warrior-ring (total: 20)\tWights can be found in Garth Agarwen in the north of Agamaur. Radagast can be found at Barad Dhorn in the Eglan-camp. Radagast the Brown has asked you to enter Garth Agarwen and discover if the legendary rings exist. If they do, he wishes them brought to him so that they may be destroyed.\n",
[10426]="70028389\n1\tConfront Trehéarn Brenin\tLhucu is at her hut in the Bonevales. You should speak with Lhucu when you are ready to depart for Lhan Gogledh.\n2\tTalk to Lhucu at her hut\tLhucu is at her hut, south of Lhan Gogledh. You should speak with Lhucu regarding the unfortunate encounter with Trehéarn Brenin and the fell spirit Mostun.\n",
[10427]="7002149F\n1\tTalk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary\tLhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs. You should travel with Lhudd to discover what lies within the ancient barrow of Cadelhin.\n2\tTalk to Lhudd at the Hall of Sanctuary\tLhudd is at the Hall of Sanctuary in the Lich Bluffs. You should speak with Lhudd again.\n",
[10428]="700281CF\n1\tDefeat wights in the Bonevales (total: 8)\tWights can be found in the valley south and west from Bledhun's camp. Bledhun asked you to enter the Bonevales and defeat the wights that have arisen from the cairns.\n2\tSpeak to Bledhun\tBledhun awaits you at his camp, north and east of the wight-infested valley. You should return to Bledhun with news of your victory.\n",
[10429]="70028250\n1\tDefeat wights in the Bone Quarry (total: 8)\tWights may be found in the Bone Quarry, east of Echad Naeglanc. Naeglanc has asked you to defeat the wights that have risen in the Bone Quarry.\n2\tTalk to Ilar at his camp in the Bonevales\tIlar is at his camp, north of the Bone Quarry and east within the valley. Naeglanc asked you to speak with Ilar after dealing with the wights in the Bone Quarry.\n",
[10430]="7005AB01\n1\tDestroy Angmarim staves (total: 3)\030Destroy Angmarim daggers (total: 3)\030Destroy Angmarim flenses (total: 3)\030Destroy phials of blood (total: 6)\tAngmarim implements can be found inside Bagud-dum. You should destroy Angmarim staves, Angmarim daggers, Angmarim flenses, and phials of blood.\n2\tHórin can be found outside the dwarf-fort Bagud-dum. You should talk to Hórin. If Hórin is no longer at Bagud-dum, he can be found at Fellgát.\t\n",
[10431]="70021E83\n1\tComplete Oaken Limbs\030Complete Mistletoe\030Complete Creeping Moss\030Complete Skin of Wood\tMost of the items Enit requires can be gathered throughout the northern Mournshaws, but the living bark may only be collected from the wild Wood-trolls that lurk west of Galar Culch. Enits has asked you to gather many natural materials for her ritual.\n2\tObserve Enit's Ritual\tEnit is at Galar Culch in the Mournshaws. She is prepared to begin the ritual to commune with one of the great spirits of the forest.\n3\tTalk to Enit at Galar Culch\tEnit is at Galar Culch in the Mournshaws. You should speak with Enit after she has communed with the spirits of the Mournshaws.\n",
[10432]="700235B0\n1\tCollect club moss (total: 4)\tThe moss Enit has requested can be gathered along the edge of the river in the north-west region of the Mournshaws.\n2\tBring the club moss to Enit at Galar Culch\tEnit is at Galar Culch in the Mournshaws. You should bring the club moss you have collected to Enit.\n",
